    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeon Adventure Gang is a co-op top-down multiplayer roguelike where you and three other adventurers team up to explore this unmarked dungeon as far as possible. Explore, gear up, reunite, and push on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147690/extras/3f020938d8dc765a8b2335529b95b450.avif?t=1730153318\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Randomly generated dungeons, each with random rooms, random pathing, random loot, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple classes each with varying gameplay styles &amp; mechanics! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple dungeon styles with varying enemy pools! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Steam integrated online multiplayer along with support for locally hosted servers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Controller Support! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends and discover everything the dungeon has to offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147690/extras/24f617fb7850732134ab39034f523ba0.poster.avif?t=1730153318\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147690/extras/24f617fb7850732134ab39034f523ba0.apng?t=1730153318\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeon Adventure Gang is a co-op top-down multiplayer roguelike where you and three other adventurers team up to explore this unmarked dungeon as far as possible. Explore, gear up, reunite, and push on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147690/extras/3f020938d8dc765a8b2335529b95b450.avif?t=1730153318\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Randomly generated dungeons, each with random rooms, random pathing, random loot, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple classes each with varying gameplay styles &amp; mechanics! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple dungeon styles with varying enemy pools! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Steam integrated online multiplayer along with support for locally hosted servers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Controller Support! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends and discover everything the dungeon has to offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147690/extras/24f617fb7850732134ab39034f523ba0.poster.avif?t=1730153318\" media=\"(prefers-red